---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title={`Contact - ${SITE_TITLE}`} currentPath="/contact">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Contact</h1>

    <p>This page is intentionally minimal until real contact details are added.</p>

    <h2>Before Launch</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Add your real email address</li>
      <li>Add your GitHub, X, LinkedIn, or other public profiles</li>
      <li>If you need a form, connect it to a real backend or form service</li>
    </ul>

    <p>The previous placeholder form was removed because it looked functional but did not actually send anything.</p>

    <p><a href="/">← Back to home</a></p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
